    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:45:29 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Feed it during a timer or a watch and the shift ends mid sugar rush? It now crashes with its own goodnight line. On long shifts it no longer looks tired all the time: it just nods off now and then, and a pizza keeps it alert for a while.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/ffeaturesque/grumlin/releases/download/v1.1.1/Grumlin-1.1.1.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="p8OuzqKkNBOvJi/5Skke6X2b1qvNpHnc9Vr+fNIVEL8Nkdd7Oio6Xhm+G40DIEJw6JCrsoF2sk5/CjBnfwOHBg==" length="1978309" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:33:02 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>New grumlin terminal command: run grumlin make (or any command) and the Mac stays awake until it finishes. Several commands can be watched at once; Grumlin naps after the last one. New icon. Friendlier wording here and there. Also on Homebrew: brew install --cask ffeaturesque/tap/grumlin</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/ffeaturesque/grumlin/releases/download/v1.1/Grumlin-1.1.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="TfnHozIdrt1uxjE9VSzwPlwtjQKhZX3bArrk9ui0XKIFnJ/4FtXq5/1crbVAZ/EZh3HM6njRW4aPKJUT02aSAA==" length="1974548" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.2</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:42:23 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>New: Wake Up at Launch, so Grumlin can start the day awake (off by default). Feed After Midnight now sits in its own menu group.</p>]]></description>
